<title>ISRAEL: Israel's Oct CPI +0.8 pct vs +0.4 pct in Sept.</title>
<headline>Israel's Oct CPI +0.8 pct vs +0.4 pct in Sept.</headline>
<dateline>JERUSALEM 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Central Bureau of</p>
<p>Statistics issued the following economic indicator:</p>
<p>ISRAEL CONSUMER PRICES   Oct 96    Sep 96    Oct 95</p>
<p>Month-on-month change    + 0.8     + 0.4     + 1.0</p>
<p>Year-on-year change	+11.1     +11.4     + 8.4</p>
<p>Index (base 100=1993)    141.1     140.0     127.0</p>
<p>Note: To compare previous indices based on 1987=100.0,</p>
<p>multiply indices from January 1994 by 2.421.</p>
</text>
